<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Cenbank to announce monetary base data.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Cenbank to announce monetary base data.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's Central Bank was due to announce monetary base data for the month of June at 1100 local/1400 GMT Monday, a bank spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>The Central Bank was also due to announce figures relating to public sector debt and the government's operational accounts, she said.</p>
<p>(( -- Brasilia newsroom 5561 3141193))</p>
